?><section class="vendor-onboarding"><div class="vendor-hero"><h2>HUNTER WALLET ADMIN · MASTER VENDOR ONBOARDING &amp; KYC</h2><span>Complete outlet registration, verification, settlement and QR control</span></div><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="form-grid vendor-form"><?=csrf_field()?><h3 class="form-section-title">1. Shop / outlet identity</h3><div class="field"><label>Shop / outlet business name</label><input name="shop_name" required placeholder="Royal Cafe &amp; South Indian"></div><div class="field"><label>System Vendor ID</label><input value="Auto-generated on save" readonly></div><div class="field"><label>Store logo</label><input name="logo_file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"><input name="logo_path" placeholder="Or protected logo path"></div><div class="field"><label>Store banner / image</label><input name="cover_file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"><input name="cover_image_path" placeholder="Or protected banner path"></div><div class="field"><label>GPS latitude</label><input name="latitude" type="number" step="0.0000001" required></div><div class="field"><label>GPS longitude</label><input name="longitude" type="number" step="0.0000001" required></div><div class="field full"><label>Complete address &amp; landmark</label><textarea name="address" required></textarea></div><div class="field"><label>Proximity beacon / radar radius (m)</label><input name="proximity_radius_m" type="number" min="1" value="300" required></div><div class="field"><label>YouTube promotional link</label><input name="youtube_promo_url" type="url" placeholder="https://youtube.com/@royalcafe"></div><h3 class="form-section-title">2. Owner details &amp; KYC proofs</h3><div class="field"><label>Owner full name</label><input name="owner_name" required></div><div class="field"><label>Registered mobile / login OTP</label><input name="mobile" required></div><div class="field"><label>Official email</label><input name="email" type="email"></div><div class="field"><label>OTP verification</label><select name="mobile_otp_verified"><option value="0">Not verified</option><option value="1">Verified</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label>Owner personal address</label><textarea name="owner_address"></textarea></div><div class="field"><label>Identity proof document/path</label><input name="identity_proof_path" required placeholder="Aadhaar / voter ID path"></div><div class="field"><label>Address proof document/path</label><input name="address_proof_path" required placeholder="Electricity bill / rent agreement path"></div><div class="field"><label>GSTIN / trade licence</label><input name="gstin"></div><div class="field"><label>KYC approval status</label><select name="kyc_status"><option>PENDING</option><option>VERIFIED</option><option>APPROVED</option><option>REJECTED</option></select></div><h3 class="form-section-title">3. Bank &amp; settlement</h3><div class="field"><label>Bank account holder</label><input name="bank_account_holder"></div><div class="field"><label>Bank account number</label><input name="bank_account_number"></div><div class="field"><label>IFSC code</label><input name="bank_ifsc" placeholder="ICIC0000123"></div><div class="field"><label>Branch</label><input name="bank_branch"></div><div class="field"><label>Settlement UPI / QR ID</label><input name="settlement_upi"></div><div class="field"><label>Cancelled cheque / bank proof path</label><input name="cancelled_cheque_path" placeholder="/uploads/kyc/cancelled-cheque.pdf"></div><div class="field"><label>Automatic settlement cycle</label><select name="settlement_cycle"><option>DAILY</option><option>WEEKLY</option><option>MONTHLY</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Bank verification status</label><select name="bank_verification_status"><option>PENDING</option><option>VERIFIED</option><option>REJECTED</option></select></div><h3 class="form-section-title">4. Category, commission &amp; operations</h3><div class=